[2025-04-14 21:29:13,208][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Eptalights Research analyzes PHP code at the bytecode level, providing a reliable method for understanding execution. Its technology converts Zend bytecode into a Pythonic model, simplifying the analysis of obfuscated PHP code that is hard to interpret at the source level. This is especially useful for obfuscated code with goto statements or encoded files using loaders, granting access to control flow, variables, and call sites even when the source is obscured.[\n]"
