[2025-04-14 21:29:13,479][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Google has launched Sec-Gemini v1, an experimental AI model that boosts cybersecurity. It merges advanced features with real-time knowledge, outperforming other models in key benchmarks. Sec-Gemini v1 empowers defenders with detailed threat analysis and vulnerability insights.[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:13,479][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                &lt;/span&gt;[\n]"
