[2025-04-14 21:29:13,496][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Researchers at the Berlin-based security startup thinkAwesome GmbH discovered a vulnerability in Unitree Go1 robot dogs. The robots include a service called CloudSail, which is a remote access tunnel service that was preinstalled on the devices. The researchers discovered that anyone with the default credentials and a specific API key could remotely control the robots and access their cameras.[\n]"
