[2025-04-14 21:29:13,578][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    API testing firm APIsec has confirmed it exposed customer data after an unprotected internal database was found online. The leak included sensitive information about employees and security practices. APIsec&apos;s founder initially downplayed the incident but later admitted it was a result of human error.[\n]"
