[2025-04-14 21:29:13,589][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    HTTPS RR is a DNS record that provides metadata about a target hostname. It offers features like ECH config and ALPN list for secure connections. curl has experimental support for HTTPS RR, which can be enabled in the build using specific commands. This feature aims to enhance security and efficiency in handling DNS records for improved web connections.[\n]"
