[2025-04-14 21:29:13,593][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Matt Adams, who created STRIDE GPT to function as an AI threat modeling assistant, had noticed significant differences in threat modeling performance across different models. To this end, Adams created the first ever benchmark to evaluate the capability of LLMs for threat modeling. Adams focused on local LLMs that could run on an Nvidia GeForce RTX 4090 GPU or smaller.[\n]"
