[2025-04-14 21:29:13,700][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:13,700][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "&lt;p&gt;How a &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fsafebase.io%2Fresources%2Fhidden-costs-of-manual-inbound-security-reviews%3Futm_campaign=9064005-FY25%2520TOFU%2520Campaign%26utm_source=tldr_mar_26/4/01000195d29d16e5-3f36d9e4-6db2-4d95-b0a9-45e42c8acf5d-000000/I-OgnN-swgdw_jbsBmTtOXz_aUT_Fgr3S2FSc-t9bLM=398&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;customer-facing SafeBase Trust Center and AI-driven automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for questionnaires can reduce costs and help you close deals faster.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
