[2025-04-14 21:29:13,706][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Numotion, a mobility solutions provider, faced a data breach impacting about 500,000 customers last year. Hackersaccessed employee emails from September to November 2024, risking exposureof personal, financial, and medical information.[\n]"
