[2025-04-14 21:29:13,719][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-0 << "                                    Blizzard will now allow character resurrections in World of Warcraft Classic&apos;s Hardcore mode if players die due to DDoS attacks. This policy change comes after repeated server disruptions that targeted the popular OnlyFangs guild. Players now have a fail-safe if they are targeted by these attacks.[\n]"
