[2025-04-14 21:29:15,111][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA released five Industrial Control Systems (ICS) advisories on April3, 2025. These advisories provide timely information about current security issues, vulnerabilities, and exploits surrounding ICS.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,111][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
