[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA released four Industrial Control Systems (ICS) advisories on March 25, 2025. These advisories provide timely information about current security issues, vulnerabilities, and exploits surrounding ICS.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-084-01 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-084-01&quot;&gt;ABB RMC-100&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-084-02 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-084-02&quot;&gt;Rockwell Automation Verve Asset Manager&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-084-03 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-084-03&quot;&gt;Rockwell Automation 440G TLS-Z&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-084-04 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-084-04&quot;&gt;Inaba Denki Sangyo CHOCO TEI WATCHER Mini[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,201][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA encourages users and administrators to review newly released ICS advisories for technical details and mitigations.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
