[2025-04-14 21:29:15,229][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;li&gt;GitHub: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;tj-actions changed-files through 45.0.7 allows remote attackers to discover secrets by reading actions logs&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;tj-actions changed-files through 45.0.7 allows remote attackers to discover secrets by reading actions logs&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0][0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,229][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
