[2025-04-14 21:29:15,256][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;These types of vulnerabilities are frequent attack vectors for malicious cyber actors and pose significant risks to the federal enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,257][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/binding-operational-directive-22-01&quot; title=&quot;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]established the Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog as a living list of known Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs) that carry significant risk to the federal enterprise. BOD 22-01 requires Federal Civilian Executive Branch (FCEB) agencies to remediate identified vulnerabilities by the due date to protect FCEB networks against active threats. See the&lt;a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/Reducing_the_Significant_Risk_of_Known_Exploited_Vulnerabilities_211103.pdf&quot; title=&quot;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&quot;&gt;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]for more information.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,257][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "&lt;p&gt;Although BOD 22-01 only applies to FCEB agencies, CISA strongly urges all organizat"
[2025-04-14 21:29:15,259][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-1 << "ions to reduce their exposure to cyberattacks by prioritizing timely remediation of[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; title=&quot;Catalog vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Catalog vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]as part of their vulnerability management practice. CISA will continue to add vulnerabilities to the catalog that meet the[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities&quot; title=&quot;specified criteria&quot;&gt;specified criteria&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
