s, and offboarding. Kyle recommends implementing IGA and getting end-to-end automations in place before migrating huge amounts of users to SSO, and provides a rough timeline for rolling out the IAM tech stack and onboarding applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;table role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=&quot;transparent&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent;padding:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;table role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;color:#2A2A2A;font-weight:normal;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;color:#2A2A2A;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Supply Chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:30px 0px 30px;&quot; class=&quot;dd&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;j&quot; role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;96%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&q